# Scene 10: The region's report. Starts on its own after scene 9.
# M. Jlassi's call, the region's report on the charter's success criteria
# (content/report.json), the ending card for the meters, the debrief in the
# binder, then the last screen. Skipping the ending (pause menu) during the
# call, the report or the ending card jumps to the debrief cue; the last screen
# follows the debrief as usual.

~ start
do GameState.reveal_dashboard()
M. Jlassi: (Phone.) The region's report on centre 26 is in.
do Story.show_report()
if GameState.ending() == "smooth"
	do Story.backdrop("A smooth session")
	Every paper on time, every candidate seated. The region asks for your plan as a template.
elif GameState.ending() == "strained"
	do Story.backdrop("It held, but strained")
	Centre 26 got through. Next year's plan has a few new lines.
else
	do Story.backdrop("The centre made the news")
	A photo of an unsigned envelope is on Facebook by noon.
=> debrief

~ debrief
do GameState.reveal_dashboard()
do Story.open_debrief()
=> last_screen

~ last_screen
do Story.backdrop("")
do Story.show_last_screen("Thank you!", "Ya3tikom essa7a", "Your centre's quality plan and staffing plan are done. But who tells the parents? What could still go wrong? Who prints the papers?", "Over to Team 2.")
=> END
